t 0. It will come up. If I make it 70. It will come down. I will make it 60. If I make it 80. It will come down. From bottom. Now I will type. I will type this. It will come down. I will close this file. I will close the settings tab. These are tabs. Just like chrome. I hope you know. What is it? I will tell you. Step by step. You can close the welcome page. By any chance. If you want to zoom in. Control plus. Zoom in. I am zooming in. Because I am recording. Ideally I want you to see. But when I am coding. I don't zoom in. These are related to VS code. I want to tell you. How websites work. A website. Works with 3 types of people. Imagine 3 people. Client. Server. Browser. Browser. Browser. Browser. Browser. Client. Server. I am client. You are browser. This is chrome. I am client. When I type code with harry.com. Code with harry.com. I ask. This browser. To give me code with harry.com. Or if I type. Youtube.com. I ask for youtube.com. I ask. Browser give me youtube.com. I want to watch youtube. Browser says. You want youtube. I will enter youtube.com. I will enter youtube.com. Youtube.com is brought from server. Do you understand? Youtube.com is brought from server. Brought youtube.com. And show me this screen. This work is done so fast. Because my internet speed is very fast. It is very less. But still. According to my locality. It is very fast. With this fast internet speed. These things are very fast. Client sends a request to server. Through browser. He will do what I say. He will help me. To bring this web page from server. Who is managing server? Youtube.com. Youtube.com. And inside that server. There is a code. When I type youtube.com. This code is sent. How to convert this code. This work is done by browser. Client says. Give me youtube.com. Browser says. Wait. I will ask for youtube.com. Browser goes to server. And asks for youtube.com. Server will give it. Or it will say. It is not there. Or it will say. It is not there. Whatever response. Ideally it should be 200. With that response. Browser comes back to client. I hope it is clear. Client browser server. Client to browser. Browser to server. This is how it works. This is important. When you type google.com. Client asks for google.com. Browser says. Wait. I will bring it from server. Browser goes to server. And brings it. And gives it to you. Along with google.com. Server sends images. Videos. Icons. URL of these icons is also in this code. Browser displays it. Server sends a bundle. Like this. And after passing this bundle. It is browser's job. Now further. Whatever interaction user will do. Browser will ask for additional. If i right click and inspect. If i type harry. I typed harry. It sent so many requests. For images. As you interact. Browser will send more requests. In total. It is like a restaurant. You send a request. When you send a request. A waiter takes your order. He sends your order to kitchen. Kitchen is like a server. When kitchen gives order. What did waiter do? Browser's job. Waiter gives you order. Maybe. That order is not made in kitchen. It is very rare. You don't get it. Sometimes it happens. Error. 500 error. Server is not working. Whenever you see this error. You are informed. Ideally 200. You get this webpage. You can think it like a restaurant. Whenever you type google.com. It will show you. If you type codewithharry.com. It will show you. If not. It will show you. 500 error. Whatever server sends. This cycle is going on. Client sends request. Browser sends server. Server processes request. Server sends data. Browser shows data to client. Client does something. Browser sends request to server. Server sends something. Data is sent to client. And so on. Now you will say. What is backend? Backend is. How server processes request. If you have a blog. Blog has a lot of data. What will you do? You will store every webpage. Or you will generate content. You will generate content. I will take google example. If i search harry bhai. You can see google header. Links. Format doesn't change. If i type here. Shubham. I will type shubham. Now see. When i typed harry bhai. It shows similar content. Google's backend. Backend processes data. In a way. To send HTML. When i type shubham. It sends this. When i type harry bhai. It sends this. Process of generating. Is backend. Backend can be jango. Backend can be flask. Backend can be php. Backend can be ruby on rails. Database is used in backend. Client can't see backend code. Frontend code is sent by server. How server made this code. We don't know. It is running on server. Don't get confused. We will see backend later. Now we will understand. How frontend works. Frontend is made of 3 languages. HTML. CSS. JavaScript. Every website needs. HTML, CSS, JavaScript. In most of the cases. If you use only HTML. It is basic. After that. When you use CSS. You can style it. Like this button. This button is red. This button is curvy. This is all CSS. These edges. This is all CSS. CSS is used to style. Button. Color. All these things are done by CSS. CSS is beauty. HTML is body. It is a standard. It is agreed. Every website is made on HTML. So that browser can understand. How to parse. Browser parses HTML. HTML is skeleton. It is a standard. Every website is made on HTML. Skeleton HTML. It is a standard. It is made so that. Everyone can make same pages. If someone is making browser. Then same language has to be parsed. If you have learned 80% HTML. Then you are good to go for web development. Now some things happen directly from HTML. Like if I show you. Very quick HTML code. I am writing HTML code like this. I am writing exclamation mark. I am using emmet abbreviation. You don't worry. I am writing like this. I am writing HTML. I am opening this HTML file. As soon as I open this HTML file. It will be open like this. I am opening it directly. By double clicking. I am opening it. It is not styled. It is a basic HTML file. You can make videos. I have one HTML file. I have an HTML file which I will show you with which you can run videos I will do one thing, I will change this HTML file and show you such that we can show videos in it so there is a video tag in HTML if you hit enter, then whatever video you put in src will be played like if I put video 1.mp4 here you see VS code automatically showed me video 1.mp4, this is the benefit of using VS code so you see here, I will reload it so here this video is automatically played, I can play it to play it, I have to write controls and I will refresh it, so I will get controls to play it, I can play it this is a ship, to sell it a person needs a lot money, he needs cash he is asking for 130 crores final, absolutely now if I put video 2.mp4 here I put video 1 here, I have 2 more videos outside, I have some more videos here, if I put it here and after this I will refer them if I put video 2.mp4 instead of it, then video 2 will be seen I will reload it and show you so if you put video 2.mp4 and you put video 2.mp4 and show it to people what is it? these were Ben Stokes lookalikes now if I put video 3 here so my third video will play, so I will reload it and you see I can play it hey sir, give me something to eat so this is our third video I put video 3.mp4 here so I will close it and in the same way we can play video 4 and video 4 is a DJ video, in which DJ plays so you see so you can make such things only by using HTML, that means you don't have to do anything else you can play videos only by using HTML you can display images, all this can be done only by using HTML, now if you want to style it, like I want a border to come on it or a red color background, then what I have to do for that I have to use CSS CSS adds beauty to any website then comes JavaScript which adds interaction to you in a website, for example what will happen when I click on search what will happen when I write code with Harry like code with HR and here auto complete came why did it come, it came because a request went to the server and for this query auto complete results came here so all these things are done by JavaScript we call it client side scripting means if we want to do scripting coding in the client only on the client side, then we can do it with the help of JavaScript, this is also a brain so our website is beauty with brain I am talking about the website, beauty with brain CSS adds beauty and brain comes from JavaScript now JavaScript helps you to make the page dynamic easily like if you want to change the content without loading the page, then all this work is done by JavaScript a lot of mosquitoes are coming here so let me kill these mosquitoes they are so weird, nothing is happening to them my racket is working oh my god so when I was in college someone told me that HTML, CSS, JavaScript you have to learn learn 100% HTML, learn 100% CSS till you learn all the properties but this is wrong why? because HTML you learn only 80% and CSS you learn only 40-60% and JavaScript you learn only 50-70% you can start web development you can make projects and while making you can move forward in this course I will tell you about the impact of chat gpt and web development so we will talk about this too you guys stay tuned so never run after perfection with HTML, CSS don't think that I will do HTML for one year then CSS for next year, then JavaScript for third year then in fourth year I will make projects don't think like this, do HTML 80%, CSS 40-60% and JavaScript you can learn 50-70% you can make a great website and as you make website your experience will teach you more HTML, CSS, JavaScript and you won't even know that you have perfected HTML, CSS, JavaScript while you are making money and working as a professional web developer so you guys are earning along with learning and with that you are also improving your skills so never think that I will make website only when I will remember all HTML tags only when I will remember all CSS properties only when I will remember all JavaScript I wil